{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんでございやすっ！\nヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははっ！\nなんでかねっ\nこーんなに時が過ぎてるよヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やべえやべえ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん元気だったかな〜？\n生駒ちゃん多分元気！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょーさん！みおなたんお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れない撮影の日々だけど一生懸命頑張ってる姿をみてお姉ちゃんは凄く嬉しいし元気もらってます！\nカメラに映った時、ちゃんとみおなたんの色を出せてる所が凄いなって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてじょーさん！じょーさん！のうじょうさーん！\n会えてない。最近会えてない(；ω；)写真撮りたいよ〜(；ω；)\nいつもじょーさんのお話面白すぎて憧れてます。\n明るくて、でも芯がしっかりあって、かっこよくてかわいいじょーさん！\nこれからもよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ\n風がつめたい。\n夕日がきれい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさが生駒ちゃんのお膝にごろんとしてきたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今生駒ちゃんがみさみさのお膝の上にごろんとなってブログ書いてるよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんならぶらぶ( ˘ω˘ )♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/10/18/8851884/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ作品つくるの頑張るぜっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}